%SIXMD 1
# @?ASCII2SIX - CONVERT CHARACTER LINES TO S6REC TEXT

## DESCRIPTION

READS CHARACTER INPUT FROM STANDARD INPUT AND WRITES S6REC RECORDS TO STANDARD OUTPUT.

USAGE IS 'ASCII2SIX'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/ASCII2SIX
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/ASCII2SIX.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

